        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S30003STT, Stainless Steel Stuttgart Half Passage Lever with Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stuttgart Stainless Steel Half Passage Lever with Square Rose features a modern design, making it a popular choice of interior design professionals. It has a brushed stainless steel finish. Easy to install, this long lasting stainless steel door lever will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. This is the half passage function that features a working latch and single lever for one side of a door and includes a blank plate for the opposite side.  It is most commonly used on a closet door that doesn't require a lever on the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stuttgart Door Leverset with Square Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits all standard 2-1/8\" pre-bored doors</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid stainless steel lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Includes Lever, latch, blank cover plate, and strike</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Stuttgart Lever with Modern Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.38\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
